 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nAlbion Components Ltd                              MASTER SERVICES\n221 Baker Street, M1 2AB Manchester, United Kingdom          AGREEMENT\nVAT No: GB590772421\n\nFROM                                              BILL TO\n\nAlbion Components Ltd                             Thamesview Logistics Ltd\n221 Baker Street                                  221 Baker Street\nM1 2AB Manchester                                 BS1 5TR Bristol\nUnited Kingdom                                    United Kingdom\nVAT: GB590772421\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 22/03/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Albion Components Ltd, with its registered office at 221 Baker Street, Manchester (\"Party A\"), and Thamesview\nLogistics Ltd, with its registered office at 221 Baker Street, Bristol (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Albion Components Ltd / Oliver Bennett\nParty B    Thamesview Logistics Ltd / Amelia Clarke\nDate       22/03/2026",
